#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:1 c93d2aff9cfb467788eabc7a4ca2ed96
msgid "HighTorque Panthera HT"
msgstr "高擎 Panthera HT"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:3 7fdd495341474859a9f4365cad08b55a
msgid ""
"**HighTorque** (高擎) is the brand. **Panthera HT** is that brand’s dual-arm "
"**manipulator**. Workspace: `open-deploy-ws` branch `panthera-ht`. It is not"
" ARX Lift 2S (no mobile chassis)."
msgstr ""
"**高擎**（HighTorque）是品牌。**Panthera HT** 是该品牌的双臂 **操作臂**。工作空间：`open-deploy-ws` "
"分支 `panthera-ht`。它不是方舟无限 Lift 2S（没有移动底盘）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:5 cbf1074856ec4d8fa21e21490b19471d
msgid ""
"Brand labels follow [robot_usds README_zh-CN.md "
"§3.1](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README_zh-"
"CN.md#31-中文简称与英文标识对照): 高擎 = HighTorque / Panthera."
msgstr ""
"品牌标注遵循 [robot_usds README_zh-CN.md §3.1](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README_zh-CN.md#31-中文简称与英文标识对照)：高擎 = HighTorque / "
"Panthera。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:7 ad9deb5fc6094a6db0617fddba6b0935
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "以源仓库为准"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:10 29c9d66361634b69a7d1a96c55bc52cd
msgid "Follow the branch README. Do not invent extra launch flags."
msgstr "遵循分支 README。不要编造额外的 launch 参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:12 8574f879f8cb41ca8ea8c948e62395ad
msgid ""
"Chinese: [open-deploy-ws `panthera-ht` README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/panthera-ht/README.md)"
msgstr ""
