"sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/panthera-ht/README.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:13 200de81783244c318c3c880d94cde3df
msgid ""
"English: [README.EN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
