"ws/blob/panthera-ht/README.EN.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:16 b7d1d63cc6e146b3a2d11fed821eab61
msgid "Robot launch name in that README is `panthera_ht`."
msgstr "该 README 中的机器人 launch 名是 `panthera_ht`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:18 6267e2e3bec2414f993ae133dcf1442c
msgid "Clone and init"
msgstr "克隆与初始化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:20 f3d76dcb62d64f4bbe9d53cbe228690a
msgid "Field zip"
msgstr "现场 zip"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:22 7a5b7bfc5ddb44e1a66310589a51889d
msgid "README “quick deployment”: unzip (example `~/ht-deploy-ws`), then:"
msgstr "README「快速部署」：解压（示例 `~/ht-deploy-ws`），然后："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:24 3fb5547fe7c54921b5932cc38e627458
msgid ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./release.sh --install\n"
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./release.sh --install\n"
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:31 a429a0a45dfe4f98934e34a94172267a
msgid "Git clone (development)"
msgstr "Git 克隆（开发）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:33 7c16867c9df2446e96cfb365a7dae039
msgid ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b panthera-ht git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git ht-deploy-ws\n"
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b panthera-ht git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git ht-deploy-ws\n"
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:40 b268159778014f1d87d112045d68600e
msgid ""
"Then `source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash` and `./quick_start.sh` to build."
msgstr "然后 `source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash` 并运行 `./quick_start.sh` 进行编译。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:42 1e8f00c81aea4c038e0dc4d3714eb53e
msgid "Build and launch (scripts first)"
msgstr "编译与启动（脚本优先）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:44 65a923c8d7394d918e96cdfd41756e2e
msgid ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/ht-deploy-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:49 4f62571b3f064e94bb296b6a14736186
msgid ""
"README: **Build** (simulation vs real-hardware packages), then **Launch** "
"(single / dual arm, simulation or real). Real hardware uses serial "
"(`/dev/ttyACM*`); the script prompts for permissions."
msgstr ""
"README：**编译**（仿真 vs 真机软件包），然后 **启动**（单臂 / "
"双臂，仿真或真机）。真机使用串口（`/dev/ttyACM*`）；脚本会提示权限。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:51 b9f136d23ec04e02a33d060ef18a3ddb
msgid ""
"Isomorphic teleop (同构遥操作) on this branch is `./teleop_start.sh` (master / "
"slave). See [Isomorphic Teleop](7-isomorphic_teleop.md) and the same README "
"section on `teleop_start.sh`. Drag teaching (拖动遥操作) is **not** a separate "
"implemented stack."
msgstr ""
"该分支上的同构遥操作是 `./teleop_start.sh`（主 / 从）。见 [同构遥操作](7-isomorphic_teleop.md) "
"以及同一 README 中关于 `teleop_start.sh` 的章节。拖动示教（拖动遥操作）**不是** 另一套已实现的栈。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:53 8208a3562ded45cba6e05d1ee36b4199
msgid "Optional README launch lines"
msgstr "README 中的可选 launch 行"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:55 7441d3f7ab8149b8b601f84d18ba00a0
msgid "Prefer the script. README equivalents:"
msgstr "优先用脚本。README 等价命令："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:57 2fa1d54b5459481e9beefae135e2febc
msgid ""
"source ~/ht-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht type:=dual\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht type:=single hardware:=real\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht type:=dual hardware:=real"
msgstr ""
"source ~/ht-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht type:=dual\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht type:=single hardware:=real\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=panthera_ht type:=dual hardware:=real"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/12-panthera_ht.md:65 c45bec660a4e4ff1906e20c4e44f2c9e
msgid ""
"Zenoh: same as other deploy hosts — `ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` and "
"`RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` (README)."
msgstr ""
"Zenoh：与其他部署主机相同 — `ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` 和 "
"`RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`（README）。"

